@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam ArrowFontColor #334155
skinparam ArrowFontSize 13
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #F7FAFD
skinparam packageBorderColor #9FB3C8
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #E7F0FB
skinparam componentBorderColor #1769B5
skinparam componentFontColor #133B61
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
top to bottom direction
title Banking Operations Analysis — Component Diagram (Draft)
package "Browser / Frontend — Angular" {
 component "Web Interface\nLogin, accounts, transactions, PDF import and chat\nCharts: ECharts | Graph: Cytoscape.js\nAPI client: Angular HttpClient" as ui
}
package "Backend — Python / FastAPI (one application)" {
 component "REST API and Access Control\nAuthentication, ownership, Pydantic validation" as api
 component "Transaction Management\nAccounts, wallets, manual CRUD and categories\nPDF import / validation / Pandas normalisation\nDuplicate and internal-transfer review" as tx
 component "Chat Assistant\nOrchestration and controlled read-only functions" as chat
 component "Financial Analytics\nExact decimal calculations per currency" as fin
 component "Graph Analytics\nNetworkX; identifier-based connections" as graph
 component "Data Access\nSQLAlchemy; user-owned records and decisions" as data
 api ..> tx
 api ..> chat
 api ..> fin
 api ..> graph
 chat ..> fin
 chat ..> graph
 tx ..> data
 fin ..> data
 graph ..> data
}
database "PostgreSQL\nAuthoritative data store" as db #E8F1EA
component "External LLM API\nProvider undecided" as llm #E5E7EB
ui ..> api : HTTPS REST\nJSON / multipart PDFs
chat ..> llm : Sanitised context\nHTTPS API
data ..> db
legend bottom
Dashed arrows: main dependencies; results and evidence return to the caller.
Duplicates count once; confirmed internal transfers are excluded from income / expenses.
LLM has no direct database access or write tools. PDF extraction library: undecided.
endlegend
@enduml
